==Strategy==
Treat this stage as a way easier [[Home Sweet Mausoleum]] if you have all the [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], or put [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] in your lineup and get ready for a longer fight.

Send in [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]] to make Znaches burrow, use [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Flying Cat]] or [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] to take them down, then kill them again later for money. Repeat until you can send in an [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]].

Beware, for the Znaches have huge burrow distance. They will always appear in front of your base in this stage. Take them down quickly.

If you have [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]], spawning it immediately and placing it right in front of the enemy base lets you have a little breathing room after the Znaches unburrow, making the stage easier.

On the off chance that you have all Anti-Starred Alien Treasures, when attempting this on higher Crown difficulties, just summoning a Fishman Cat after all the Znaches burrow should be enough to terminate the Spacefish Jones, allowing you to send in Awakened Bahamut and destroy the base early.

==Trivia==
*Nikumanjaro may be a portmanteau of ''[[wikipedia:Nikuman|Nikuman]]'', the Japanese name for a type of Chinese baozi, and ''[[wikipedia:Mount Kilimanjaro|Mount Kilimanjaro]]'', a mountain located in Africa.

